# Architecture & Implementation Plan: Institutional Point-in-Time (PIT) Truth Database

This document establishes the blueprint for engineering an audit-grade **Point-in-Time (PIT) Truth Database** for Indian Equities (NSE/BSE), eliminating all simulated, hardcoded, or generic media noise.

---

