## 6. Forward Catalyst Engine (SEBI LODR Calendar Integration)

Under **SEBI LODR Regulation 29**, listed companies must provide advance notice of Board Meetings (5 days for results, 2 days for dividends/splits).

### Tracked Forward Fields per Stock:
```text
next_board_meeting_date:    2026-10-28
days_until_announcement:    12 Days
expected_event_type:        Q2_FINANCIAL_RESULTS_AND_INTERIM_DIVIDEND
event_urgency_status:       SCHEDULED (Monitored)
insider_blackout_active:    TRUE (Trading window closed)
```

