- **`cash_flows`**: `statement_id`, `security_id`, `period_end_date`, `publication_timestamp`, `operating_cash_flow` (CFO), `capex`, `investing_cash_flow` (CFI), `financing_cash_flow` (CFF), `free_cash_flow` (FCF = CFO - CapEx).
