## 9. Verification & Data Quality Framework

Every ingested dataset is subjected to the Data Quality Gate:
1. **Freshness:** Verified against current exchange timestamp.
2. **Double-Entry Balance Sheet Validation:** $\text{Assets} == \text{Liabilities} + \text{Equity} \ (\pm 1\%)$.
3. **Cash Flow Reconciliation:** $\text{Closing Cash} == \text{Opening Cash} + \text{CFO} + \text{CFI} + \text{CFF}$.
4. **Candle Integrity:** $\text{High} \ge \max(\text{Open}, \text{Close}) \ge \min(\text{Open}, \text{Close}) \ge \text{Low}$.
5. **No Lookahead Guarantee:** In tests, any query as of Date $T$ asserting that records with `publication_timestamp > T` are excluded.

